    "title": "BBQ and brews coming to fairgrounds - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Bloomsburg, Pa. — The popular BBQ & Brews Music Festival is headed back to the Bloomsburg Fairgrounds this month for a family-friendly three-day event! The festival runs Friday, Aug. 15 through Sunday, Aug. 17. Gates are open Friday and Saturday from 11 a.m. to 9 p.m. and Sunday from 11 a.m. to 5 p.m. There will be more than a dozen breweries, distilleries, and wineries at the event, along with nearly 40 food trucks, including plenty of BBQ, and other vendors. Music Schedule Friday: 12–1:30 p.m. – The Dishonest Fiddlers2–3:30 p.m. – Cumberland Honey4–5:30 p.m. – Strawberry Ridge6–7:30 p.m. – Uncle Jake & the 18 Wheel Gang8–9:30 p.m. – Serene Green Saturday: 12–1:30 p.m. – Highway 112–3:30 p.m. – Hi-Fye4–5:30 p.m. – The Mighty Susquehannas6–7:30 p.m. – Mike Elward Band8–9:30 p.m. – Wes Shipp Band Sunday: 10–11 a.m. – Steven Wright (Motivational Speaker)12–1:15 p.m. – So much hope, buried.1:45–3 p.m. – Rustic Remedies3:30–5 p.m. – The Beautiful Distortion DockDogs Schedule Friday: 11 a.m. – Big Air Wave #11 p.m. – Big Air Wave #23 p.m. – Big Air Wave #35 p.m. – Big Air Wave #46:30 p.m. – Extreme Vertical Saturday: 11 a.m. – Big Air Wave #51 p.m. – Big Air Wave #63 p.m. – Big Air Wave #75 p.m. – Big Air Wave #86:30 p.m. – Extreme Vertical Sunday: 11 a.m. – Big Air Wave #91 p.m. – Speed Retrieve3:30 p.m. – Big Air Finals Tickets can be purchased here or at the gate.",
